cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ASHWA in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ASHWA: Agentic System Health & Workload Analysis"
abstract: >-
  An AWR-style diagnostic report for AI agents: load profile, time model, top
  calls, efficiency ratios, trajectories and a compare-periods report, built
  from the traces an agent sends to Langfuse.
authors:
  - family-names: Pawar
    given-names: Sachin
version: "0.1"
repository-code: "https://github.com/smpawar/ashwa"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - observability
  - performance-analysis
  - langfuse
  - clickhouse
  - oracle-awr
